#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization by configuring IAM, "
"resource groups, and access groups."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi IBM Quantum Platform untuk sesebuah organisasi dengan "
"mengkonfigurasi IAM, kumpulan sumber, dan kumpulan akses."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization"
msgstr "Konfigurasi IBM Quantum Platform untuk sesebuah organisasi"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization {#configure-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-for-an-organization}"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi IBM Quantum Platform untuk sesebuah organisasi {#configure-ibm-"
"quantum-platform-for-an-organization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to set up IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah ini untuk menyediakan IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"iam-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"iam-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Configure IAM settings {#1-configure-iam-settings}"
msgstr "1. Konfigurasi tetapan IAM {#1-configure-iam-settings}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, configure the following settings in the administrator's IAM account. "
"To review and configure these settings, go to [Manage → IAM → "
"Settings](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/settings).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, konfigurasi tetapan berikut dalam akaun IAM pentadbir. Untuk "
"menyemak dan mengkonfigurasi tetapan ini, pergi ke [Manage → IAM → "
"Settings](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/settings).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**User list visibility** determines whether users can see each other, "
"regardless of project assignment. The `enabled` setting restricts user "
"visibility. That is, users in your account cannot see each other, even if "
"they can access the same resources. Choose the appropriate value for your "
"environment. See [Controlling user "
"visibility](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-user-"
"setting) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Keterlihatan senarai pengguna** menentukan sama ada pengguna boleh melihat"
" antara satu sama lain, tanpa mengira tugasan projek. Tetapan `enabled` "
"mengehadkan keterlihatan pengguna. Maksudnya, pengguna dalam akaun anda "
"tidak dapat melihat antara satu sama lain, walaupun mereka boleh mengakses "
"sumber yang sama. Pilih nilai yang sesuai untuk persekitaran anda. Lihat "
"[Mengawal keterlihatan "
"pengguna](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-user-setting)"
" untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**API key creation** controls whether users can create API keys. In IBM "
"Quantum Platform, it is common to use API keys. If API keys are being used, "
"choose `disabled`. Alternatively, you can give specific permissions to each "
"user.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Penciptaan kunci API** mengawal sama ada pengguna boleh mencipta kunci "
"API. Dalam IBM Quantum Platform, kunci API biasa digunakan. Jika kunci API "
"digunakan, pilih `disabled`. Sebagai alternatif, anda boleh memberi "
"kebenaran khusus kepada setiap pengguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"crt-rsc-grp-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"crt-rsc-grp-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. (Optional) Create resource groups {#2-optional-create-resource-groups}"
msgstr ""
"2. (Pilihan) Cipta kumpulan sumber {#2-optional-create-resource-groups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this step if you are using access groups that directly reference IBM "
"Quantum service instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"Langkah ini boleh dilangkau jika anda menggunakan kumpulan akses yang "
"merujuk terus kepada instans perkhidmatan IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you chose to use resource groups, go to [Manage → Account → Resource "
"groups (in Account resources)](https://cloud.ibm.com/account/resource-"
"groups) and click **Create**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda memilih untuk menggunakan kumpulan sumber, pergi ke [Manage → "
"Account → Resource groups (dalam Account "
"resources)](https://cloud.ibm.com/account/resource-groups) dan klik "
"**Create**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-instance-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-instance-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Create IBM Quantum service instances {#3-create-ibm-quantum-service-"
"instances}"
msgstr ""
"3. Cipta instans perkhidmatan IBM Quantum {#3-create-ibm-quantum-service-"
"instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If you already created IBM Quantum service instances, skip this step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda telah mencipta instans perkhidmatan IBM Quantum, langkau langkah "
"ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are using resource groups, make sure to create the service instances "
"on the appropriate resource group.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda menggunakan kumpulan sumber, pastikan anda mencipta instans "
"perkhidmatan pada kumpulan sumber yang sesuai.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The service instance name, such as `QR-ml`, is needed for access group "
"references.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nama instans perkhidmatan, seperti `QR-ml`, diperlukan untuk rujukan "
"kumpulan akses.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in [Set up to use IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) for"
" instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti langkah-langkah dalam [Sediakan untuk menggunakan IBM "
"Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) untuk arahan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-group-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-group-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. Create access groups for projects {#4-create-access-groups-for-projects}"
msgstr ""
"4. Cipta kumpulan akses untuk projek {#4-create-access-groups-for-projects}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, [create a custom role](/guides/custom-roles#custom) that allows users to perform actions to work with IBM Quantum service instances.\n"
"Next, [create an access group](/guides/access-groups) for each project and give that group the minimum set of permissions that are required to work with the project resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, [cipta peranan tersuai](/guides/custom-roles#custom) yang membolehkan pengguna melakukan tindakan untuk bekerja dengan instans perkhidmatan IBM Quantum.\n"
"Seterusnya, [cipta kumpulan akses](/guides/access-groups) untuk setiap projek dan berikan kumpulan tersebut set kebenaran minimum yang diperlukan untuk bekerja dengan sumber projek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"setup-idp-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"setup-idp-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. Set up your ID provider and assign users {#5-set-up-your-id-provider-and-"
"assign-users}"
msgstr ""
"5. Sediakan penyedia ID anda dan tugaskan pengguna {#5-set-up-your-id-"
"provider-and-assign-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the appropriate topic, depending on the ID provider you "
"chose to use:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti langkah-langkah dalam topik yang sesuai, bergantung pada penyedia ID "
"yang anda pilih:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use IBM Cloud&reg; as the ID provider for users that have IBM Cloud "
"accounts](/guides/manage-cloud-users)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gunakan IBM Cloud&reg; sebagai penyedia ID untuk pengguna yang mempunyai "
"akaun IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-cloud-users)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use IBM Cloud as the ID provider for users that do not have IBM Cloud "
"accounts](/guides/manage-appid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gunakan IBM Cloud sebagai penyedia ID untuk pengguna yang tidak mempunyai "
"akaun IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-appid)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use an ID provider other than IBM Cloud for users that do not have IBM "
"Cloud accounts](/guides/manage-appid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gunakan penyedia ID selain IBM Cloud untuk pengguna yang tidak mempunyai "
"akaun IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-appid)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Invite users and manage their access](/guides/invite-and-manage-users)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Jemput pengguna dan urus akses mereka](/guides/invite-and-manage-users)\n"

#. type: Plain text
